        "yaw": -0.45,
        "lines": [
          [
            "红蜡封条还在，箱子就没有被开过。至少规矩上是这么说的。",
            "An intact red seal means a crate has not been opened. That is the rule, anyway."
          ],
          [
            "走中间这条通道，别踩到秤盘和货绳。",
            "Keep to the middle passage and mind the scales and cargo ropes."
